      "message": "test(edm): pin every angle-word refusal and the stamp's taper rules\n\nReview of PR #1218 (mutation check): each new refusal and stamp line\nnow has a test that fails when the line is deleted - the stamp's\ncorner rule and dialect (wire_taper_angle), the script's four\nangle-word refusals on hand-built streams (script_wire_iso), the\npost-side lean refusals (posting_wire unit tests; the angle-word lean\nmoved into angle_lean, behaviour unchanged, so its door refusals are\nreachable by a test), the taper_angle parse and wire-key refusals,\nand the cone rule's turn-back refusal.\n\nRefs #1164\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
